1
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:03,586
Strawberry Candy?

2
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,928
Ruyi, long time no see.

3
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,014
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:17,976
I came to see how you and Taozi are doing.

5
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:20,353
She's so cute.

6
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:22,313
Yeah.

7
00:00:23,106 --> 00:00:29,153
I'm sorry I moved out
without explaining things to you.

8
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:33,366
I just felt bad because you'd already done
so much for us.

9
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:36,202
Have you been doing okay?

10
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:41,750
Actually, I'm dead.

11
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:45,794
It's just...

12
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:49,423
the day Taozi was born,
I didn't want you to be alone.

13
00:00:49,424 --> 00:00:52,050
I rushed to the hospital to be with you.

14
00:00:52,051 --> 00:00:53,928
And then...

15
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:56,514
I got into an accident on the way.

16
00:01:00,226 --> 00:01:01,227
You're dead?

17
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:10,487
You were coming to see us,

18
00:01:13,281 --> 00:01:14,407
and then you got...

19
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,326
hit by a car and died?

20
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:21,538
Hey, it's okay. I wasn't paying attention.

21
00:01:21,539 --> 00:01:24,792
I saw a cat crossing the road,

22
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:29,046
tried to swerve around it
and ended up crashing.

23
00:01:29,047 --> 00:01:32,257
But it all happened in an instant.
No pain.

24
00:01:32,258 --> 00:01:33,801
I was just...

25
00:01:33,802 --> 00:01:35,010
gone.

26
00:01:35,011 --> 00:01:37,846
Ruyi, don't cry. Why are you crying?

27
00:01:37,847 --> 00:01:39,431
Did it hurt a lot?

28
00:01:39,432 --> 00:01:42,226
It didn't hurt. I died instantly.

29
00:01:42,227 --> 00:01:44,938
- So don't cry.
- Then why did you come here?

30
00:01:46,481 --> 00:01:47,315
I...

31
00:01:48,691 --> 00:01:51,694
I was worried about you.

32
00:01:53,279 --> 00:01:55,156
Are you okay now?

33
00:01:56,324 --> 00:01:57,367
I...

34
00:02:01,287 --> 00:02:02,704
Are you two doing okay?

35
00:02:02,705 --> 00:02:03,706
I...

36
00:02:04,582 --> 00:02:05,416
So...

37
00:02:06,709 --> 00:02:08,002
have you two

38
00:02:08,878 --> 00:02:10,964
thought about me at all?

39
00:02:17,387 --> 00:02:18,763
You really did?

40
00:03:32,211 --> 00:03:33,296
Where is he?

41
00:03:36,341 --> 00:03:37,467
What a mess.

42
00:03:38,968 --> 00:03:40,178
What's going on?

43
00:03:50,939 --> 00:03:52,606
<i>Give this to your daughter.</i>

44
00:03:52,607 --> 00:03:55,944
<i>They say newborns can see spirits.</i>

45
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:02,408
Out this early?

46
00:04:06,162 --> 00:04:07,663
Give me my body back!

47
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:11,041
I know this isn't fair to you,
but please calm down.

48
00:04:11,042 --> 00:04:12,960
Calm down, my ass! Go to hell!

49
00:04:12,961 --> 00:04:14,169
I'm already dead.

50
00:04:14,170 --> 00:04:15,879
Sir, are you okay?

51
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,714
Thanks for asking. I'm fine.

52
00:04:17,715 --> 00:04:18,924
What do you want?

53
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:21,677
I just want Ruyi and Taozi to be happy.

54
00:04:21,678 --> 00:04:25,222
- Don't use my body to hit on Ruyi.
- I didn't.

55
00:04:25,223 --> 00:04:26,598
You possessed me. Didn't you?

56
00:04:26,599 --> 00:04:28,892
- Can I?
- Shit! I knew it!

57
00:04:28,893 --> 00:04:31,436
I really just wanted to hold Taozi.

58
00:04:31,437 --> 00:04:32,980
Stop up ahead, please.

59
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:34,065
Okay.

60
00:04:38,403 --> 00:04:40,737
This isn't possession.
It's a three-legged race!

61
00:04:40,738 --> 00:04:43,782
I don't know.
This didn't happen last time.

62
00:04:43,783 --> 00:04:45,450
Where are you taking me?

63
00:04:45,451 --> 00:04:47,370
I'm going home to get something.

64
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:55,294
Mrs. Landlord! What a coincidence.
I need to get the key from you.

65
00:04:55,295 --> 00:04:56,212
Who are you?

66
00:04:57,046 --> 00:04:58,505
I'm the engineer upstairs.

67
00:04:58,506 --> 00:04:59,799
No, you're not.

68
00:05:01,926 --> 00:05:03,344
...a friend of his.

69
00:05:04,345 --> 00:05:05,971
I'm not his friend!

70
00:05:05,972 --> 00:05:08,890
- I...
- We're more than friends.

71
00:05:08,891 --> 00:05:10,767
The key for A202.

72
00:05:10,768 --> 00:05:15,023
Do you have some ID?
Let me take a photo, just in case.

73
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,155
Give me a second.

74
00:05:25,616 --> 00:05:26,743
You live here?

75
00:05:28,703 --> 00:05:30,620
This place is huge. How big is it?

76
00:05:30,621 --> 00:05:32,915
What's the rent? Is it expensive?

77
00:05:33,666 --> 00:05:35,917
Your underwear? What are you doing?

78
00:05:35,918 --> 00:05:38,880
I need this to take care
of Ruyi and Taozi.

79
00:05:40,548 --> 00:05:41,798
Are you rich?

80
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:45,093
Ten, hundred, thousand... a million?
You're loaded!

81
00:05:45,094 --> 00:05:46,304
Stop looking!

82
00:05:47,388 --> 00:05:50,140
Let me use you.
I'm going to withdraw some money.

83
00:05:50,141 --> 00:05:53,101
You'll make me look like a money mule!

84
00:05:53,102 --> 00:05:54,644
I won't get you into trouble.

85
00:05:54,645 --> 00:05:56,354
Possessing me is trouble enough.

86
00:05:56,355 --> 00:05:57,523
What are you doing?

87
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:01,151
I can't have sweets. I'm working out!

88
00:06:01,152 --> 00:06:02,445
I can't eat that!

89
00:06:09,285 --> 00:06:10,620
This is so good!

90
00:06:11,621 --> 00:06:13,122
It's so good!

91
00:06:13,998 --> 00:06:15,249
What is this?

92
00:06:18,211 --> 00:06:20,420
I still have some unfinished business.

93
00:06:20,421 --> 00:06:22,672
Wait... Women's clothes?

94
00:06:22,673 --> 00:06:25,300
Shit, you're a pervert!
Don't mess with my body!

95
00:06:25,301 --> 00:06:28,471
I bought them from Ruyi
when she was livestreaming.

96
00:06:30,264 --> 00:06:33,184
I died before I could
send them to the orphanage.

97
00:06:34,477 --> 00:06:36,019
- Three cans.
- Okay.

98
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:37,729
- Can I transfer the money?
- Sure.

99
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,564
I'll transfer it to you now.

100
00:06:39,565 --> 00:06:41,484
- Did you get it?
- Yeah, thanks.

101
00:06:45,863 --> 00:06:48,616
Taozi, Mommy made some money!
Isn't that great?

102
00:06:49,283 --> 00:06:53,329
Now we can buy lots of pretty clothes
and eat yummy food, okay?

103
00:06:55,706 --> 00:06:57,166
Look at you smiling!

104
00:07:00,878 --> 00:07:05,007
<i>Ruyi, free tonight?
I'd like to buy you dinner.</i>

105
00:07:07,552 --> 00:07:09,845
Ruyi! Ruyi!

106
00:07:09,846 --> 00:07:10,887
This is really it?

107
00:07:10,888 --> 00:07:14,809
I passed by and circled back.
It looked fancy. I thought I was lost.

108
00:07:16,144 --> 00:07:17,437
Yep, this is it.

109
00:07:18,271 --> 00:07:20,272
Why'd you pick such a fancy place?

110
00:07:20,273 --> 00:07:22,858
Ruyi, that's just my body.
My soul isn't in it.

111
00:07:22,859 --> 00:07:25,486
I thought we could treat ourselves
for once.

112
00:07:26,362 --> 00:07:27,612
Taozi, Uncle A-Li's right here.

113
00:07:27,613 --> 00:07:29,656
That's not Uncle A-Li! Cry! Distract them!

114
00:07:29,657 --> 00:07:30,991
Taozi, no!

115
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:32,325
Don't go in!

116
00:07:32,326 --> 00:07:33,452
I'll push Taozi.

117
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:34,704
Tree.

118
00:07:36,456 --> 00:07:37,665
Is there a typhoon?

119
00:07:38,416 --> 00:07:40,500
Let's get inside. A typhoon's coming.

120
00:07:40,501 --> 00:07:42,711
- Typhoon's here. Let's go.
- Go in first?

121
00:07:42,712 --> 00:07:43,838
Ruyi!

122
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:50,678
Hello.

123
00:07:52,513 --> 00:07:54,681
- Did you book a table?
- Yes.

124
00:07:54,682 --> 00:07:57,726
- Mr. Tseng, party of two.
- Mr. Tseng, two. One moment.

125
00:07:57,727 --> 00:07:58,935
Using my name.

126
00:07:58,936 --> 00:08:00,354
Ruyi, hold on.

127
00:08:03,816 --> 00:08:05,902
Why do you keep looking at me?

128
00:08:06,527 --> 00:08:07,777
Why are you dressed like that?

129
00:08:07,778 --> 00:08:10,780
Yeah. Pink doesn't suit me.
It's too girly.

130
00:08:10,781 --> 00:08:12,074
It suits you.

131
00:08:13,910 --> 00:08:16,162
You should've told me. I look so sloppy.

132
00:08:17,622 --> 00:08:19,207
Next time, I will.

133
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:23,294
This isn't romantic at all.

134
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,047
Taozi, hurry up and cry!
Taozi, why are you smiling?

135
00:08:27,048 --> 00:08:28,673
Taozi's happy, too.

136
00:08:28,674 --> 00:08:30,510
She's never eaten out.

137
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:33,470
Stop looking like a family.

138
00:08:33,471 --> 00:08:37,308
Why are you crying, Taozi?
It's okay. Uncle will hold you.

139
00:08:37,975 --> 00:08:38,892
There, there.

140
00:08:38,893 --> 00:08:41,979
You don't even know to support her neck?

141
00:08:43,147 --> 00:08:44,689
She's crying even louder.

142
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:45,899
Let me. I'll take her.

143
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:48,235
You're ruining my image.

144
00:08:48,236 --> 00:08:50,154
- Mr. Tseng, this way.
- Okay.

145
00:08:52,406 --> 00:08:54,200
Thought they called. You scared me.

146
00:08:55,076 --> 00:08:57,077
Focus. You can't even hold a baby.

147
00:08:57,078 --> 00:08:58,954
- Never held a baby?
- No, I haven't.

148
00:08:58,955 --> 00:09:01,414
Then practice holding her.

149
00:09:01,415 --> 00:09:03,124
- What the hell?
- Sorry.

150
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:05,961
Can you push it?
This isn't a family restaurant.

151
00:09:05,962 --> 00:09:09,130
Everyone can hear her crying.
Can't control her? Stay at home.

152
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:10,465
- What did you say?
- Mom!

153
00:09:10,466 --> 00:09:14,469
Sir, you're being too loud.
You're making my baby cry.

154
00:09:14,470 --> 00:09:16,596
- Who's bothering who?
- Go outside.

155
00:09:16,597 --> 00:09:18,223
Can't control them? Don't have kids.

156
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:20,892
Don't have kids.
Keep them out of restaurants.

157
00:09:20,893 --> 00:09:23,061
My having kids is none of your business!

158
00:09:23,062 --> 00:09:24,813
- Stop it. This is embarrassing.
- Fuck!

159
00:09:24,814 --> 00:09:26,189
You're still too loud!

160
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:29,776
- This is a nice restaurant. Keep it down.
- Let's go.

161
00:09:29,777 --> 00:09:30,986
You've got some nerve!

162
00:09:30,987 --> 00:09:33,321
- You've got some nerve!
- What are you pointing at?

163
00:09:33,322 --> 00:09:34,615
What a psycho!

164
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:37,159
You're crazy!

165
00:09:37,868 --> 00:09:38,952
Enough.

166
00:09:38,953 --> 00:09:41,830
Ruined the mood. Forget dinner.
Let's go home.

167
00:09:41,831 --> 00:09:43,582
- Ruyi, I'm sorry.
- Now I'm even hungrier.

168
00:09:43,583 --> 00:09:44,667
What should we eat?

169
00:09:45,543 --> 00:09:46,669
Adjust this chair.

170
00:09:47,753 --> 00:09:49,087
Why are they even hungrier now?

171
00:09:49,088 --> 00:09:50,714
Mr. Tseng, sorry about that.

172
00:09:50,715 --> 00:09:52,091
Right this way, please.

173
00:09:55,052 --> 00:09:57,305
Why are you blowing at me? Are you nuts?

174
00:10:01,517 --> 00:10:02,810
Much quieter now.

175
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,693
How are you enjoying the food?

176
00:10:11,402 --> 00:10:13,779
Ruyi doesn't like cold food.

177
00:10:14,614 --> 00:10:15,989
It's really good.

178
00:10:15,990 --> 00:10:18,284
Great. Glad you like it.

179
00:10:21,495 --> 00:10:23,164
But your cooking's already great.

180
00:10:24,165 --> 00:10:27,000
Why come all the way here?
It's so expensive.

181
00:10:27,001 --> 00:10:29,587
Don't worry. My treat.

182
00:10:31,047 --> 00:10:33,214
I have my own money.
You don't have to pay.

183
00:10:33,215 --> 00:10:36,051
I just wanted to be nice to you.

184
00:10:36,052 --> 00:10:38,345
Don't put words in my mouth.

185
00:10:38,346 --> 00:10:40,306
I should be the one treating you.

186
00:10:41,265 --> 00:10:44,101
You help with my livestreams
and take care of Taozi.

187
00:10:45,019 --> 00:10:46,145
Let me treat you.

188
00:10:46,729 --> 00:10:48,022
It doesn't matter who pays.

189
00:10:48,689 --> 00:10:51,025
I just want to have dinner with you.

190
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:58,658
You mean eating out together?

191
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:01,368
Our first time, I think.

192
00:11:01,369 --> 00:11:03,204
Both.

193
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:11,796
Ruyi?

194
00:11:12,671 --> 00:11:14,465
I want to ask you something.

195
00:11:15,257 --> 00:11:16,925
What are you doing?

196
00:11:16,926 --> 00:11:18,927
Don't confess with my body!

197
00:11:18,928 --> 00:11:22,139
They say you dream about
whoever's on your mind.

198
00:11:23,057 --> 00:11:26,102
Have you dreamed about anyone lately?

199
00:11:26,936 --> 00:11:28,145
Dreamed about who?

200
00:11:29,313 --> 00:11:30,398
What do you mean?

201
00:11:31,107 --> 00:11:32,357
I mean...

202
00:11:32,358 --> 00:11:35,111
is that person important to you?

203
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:39,031
<i>Not really...</i>

204
00:11:44,870 --> 00:11:46,330
Was it too noisy?

205
00:11:46,997 --> 00:11:48,289
Did it wake you up?

206
00:11:48,290 --> 00:11:51,544
Let Mommy eat for a bit. What is it?

207
00:11:53,129 --> 00:11:54,713
What's wrong?

208
00:11:57,258 --> 00:11:59,050
It's fine. Go on. What do you mean?

209
00:11:59,051 --> 00:12:01,261
It's nothing. Let's eat.

210
00:12:01,262 --> 00:12:02,304
You haven't eaten.

211
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:07,226
Stop saying whatever you want.
You hear me?

212
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,060
Are you cold?

213
00:12:09,061 --> 00:12:10,729
Is it too tight back there?

214
00:12:12,982 --> 00:12:15,526
Sir, you've got it wrong.
He's not the dad.

215
00:12:17,528 --> 00:12:20,364
Sir, please focus on driving
and not on our conversation.

216
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:28,788
I got a cab with a baby seat.

217
00:12:28,789 --> 00:12:31,249
Yeah. Why not drive yourself?

218
00:12:31,250 --> 00:12:32,667
That car's too beat-up.

219
00:12:32,668 --> 00:12:34,878
I want something bigger

220
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:37,839
and more comfortable to take Taozi out.

221
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,633
What about that EV?

222
00:12:41,385 --> 00:12:42,970
Which car?

223
00:12:44,972 --> 00:12:46,931
I saw a pretty nice SUV.

224
00:12:46,932 --> 00:12:49,893
Did you win the lottery?
Got money to burn?

225
00:12:49,894 --> 00:12:53,481
I just want you to enjoy yourself.

226
00:13:02,031 --> 00:13:04,825
What's with you today?
You're like a different person.

227
00:13:05,659 --> 00:13:06,618
Really?

228
00:13:06,619 --> 00:13:09,662
Chang Ruyi, that's not me!
Wake up, Chang Ruyi!

229
00:13:09,663 --> 00:13:12,708
That's not me! Give me my body back, now!

230
00:13:13,375 --> 00:13:17,546
I want to be with you and Taozi forever.

231
00:13:19,965 --> 00:13:21,633
Meaning what?

232
00:13:21,634 --> 00:13:24,969
You said it was temporary. Don't push it!

233
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:26,471
You can't do that.

234
00:13:26,472 --> 00:13:28,014
Maybe it is possible.

235
00:13:28,015 --> 00:13:29,808
Possible how?

236
00:13:30,893 --> 00:13:32,186
Maybe...

237
00:13:33,187 --> 00:13:34,772
if I can,

238
00:13:35,231 --> 00:13:36,774
I'll care for you forever...

239
00:13:39,401 --> 00:13:40,569
Be careful.

240
00:13:43,531 --> 00:13:45,574
What did you mean by "possible"?

241
00:13:49,453 --> 00:13:50,912
What are you doing? No!

242
00:13:50,913 --> 00:13:52,539
Ruyi, don't! Take your hand off!

243
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:53,958
Ruyi!

244
00:13:56,710 --> 00:13:58,921
Ruyi...

245
00:14:05,844 --> 00:14:08,638
There's something on you.

246
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:09,932
On me?

247
00:14:12,851 --> 00:14:15,270
- This?
- No.

248
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,729
That looks familiar.

249
00:14:16,730 --> 00:14:17,982
I...

250
00:14:18,732 --> 00:14:20,900
Grandma gave it to you.
You asked me to carry it.

251
00:14:20,901 --> 00:14:23,069
- Get rid of it.
- I thought you gave it to me.

252
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:25,613
Give it to the driver. He needs it more.

253
00:14:25,614 --> 00:14:31,412
True. Sir, you seem a little distracted.
This will keep you safe on the road.

254
00:14:36,542 --> 00:14:37,543
Ruyi.

255
00:14:39,086 --> 00:14:40,796
- I'll take her to bed first.
- Okay.

256
00:14:45,551 --> 00:14:47,553
Being a dad is tough.

257
00:14:51,348 --> 00:14:56,270
Weird. I touched the talisman,
so why do you look worse than me?

258
00:14:57,271 --> 00:14:59,648
You're possessing me. How should I know?

259
00:15:06,196 --> 00:15:07,531
Why'd you buy all this?

260
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:11,492
I went to a baby store.

261
00:15:11,493 --> 00:15:14,662
The clerk recommended these,
so I bought them.

262
00:15:14,663 --> 00:15:17,624
Taozi's too young for these.
She can't use them yet.

263
00:15:17,625 --> 00:15:19,668
Don't waste your money. Return them.

264
00:15:20,377 --> 00:15:22,754
Okay. It's up to you.

265
00:15:22,755 --> 00:15:24,213
So nosy.

266
00:15:24,214 --> 00:15:26,090
Ruyi, I might not come back.

267
00:15:26,091 --> 00:15:28,635
Ruyi, I'm right here! Ruyi!

268
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:29,970
Today...

269
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,181
you remind me of an old friend of mine.

270
00:15:33,182 --> 00:15:34,849
That's right. He's not me.

271
00:15:34,850 --> 00:15:36,602
Yeah? Who?

272
00:15:38,062 --> 00:15:41,773
Didn't you ask
if I'd dreamed about anyone?

273
00:15:41,774 --> 00:15:43,734
I dreamed about him a few days ago...

274
00:15:45,152 --> 00:15:46,653
and cried.

275
00:15:46,654 --> 00:15:49,323
- You went into her dreams? You creep!
- Well...

276
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:52,868
Were you crying because you liked him?

277
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,708
He's a good person.

278
00:16:00,709 --> 00:16:02,169
I don't want to owe him.

279
00:16:06,131 --> 00:16:07,633
Friend-zoned.

280
00:16:08,842 --> 00:16:10,593
You got the answer you wanted.

281
00:16:10,594 --> 00:16:14,138
Can I have my body back now?
Your wish came true.

282
00:16:14,139 --> 00:16:15,306
So, do you like me?

283
00:16:15,307 --> 00:16:16,433
I...

284
00:16:17,101 --> 00:16:18,893
She made it clear! Why ask again?

285
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:20,728
You just won't give up...

286
00:16:20,729 --> 00:16:21,896
You're me...

287
00:16:21,897 --> 00:16:25,733
No, wait! How can you ask her that?
I should be the one asking!

288
00:16:25,734 --> 00:16:27,443
You... This...

289
00:16:27,444 --> 00:16:29,905
Just friends, right?

290
00:16:34,618 --> 00:16:35,661
Of course.

291
00:16:37,329 --> 00:16:38,330
More like roommates.

292
00:16:39,081 --> 00:16:42,418
Taozi's asleep, so I'll take her to bed.

293
00:16:49,049 --> 00:16:50,717
Thanks for today.

294
00:16:50,718 --> 00:16:52,845
- Good night.
- Good night.

295
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:11,071
We're friends. What else?

296
00:17:12,031 --> 00:17:14,658
He doesn't want to just be friends, right?

297
00:17:17,494 --> 00:17:19,163
<i>I just wanted to be nice to you.</i>

298
00:17:19,747 --> 00:17:21,664
I should be the one treating you.

299
00:17:21,665 --> 00:17:23,041
Let me treat you.

300
00:17:23,042 --> 00:17:24,752
It doesn't matter who pays.

301
00:17:25,669 --> 00:17:29,088
I just want to have dinner with you.

302
00:17:29,089 --> 00:17:31,884
Chang Ruyi...

303
00:17:36,472 --> 00:17:38,974
Uncle A-Li was acting strange today,
wasn't he?

304
00:17:40,476 --> 00:17:41,769
Maybe he thinks

305
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:44,980
you're cute and likes you.

306
00:17:53,864 --> 00:17:56,617
I'm just a friend to Ruyi.

307
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:00,913
I'm just a roommate to Ruyi.

308
00:18:02,456 --> 00:18:04,207
I guess so.

309
00:18:04,208 --> 00:18:06,459
Why would she ever like someone like me?

310
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:07,835
Yeah.

311
00:18:07,836 --> 00:18:12,091
Why would she like a body snatcher?
Give me my body back!

312
00:18:14,718 --> 00:18:16,970
- Your hand.
- What's wrong with it?

313
00:18:17,596 --> 00:18:19,264
My hand! Where is it?

314
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,350
My hand!

315
00:18:22,601 --> 00:18:23,559
A-Li, what's wrong?

316
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:24,685
- My hand!
- Where?

317
00:18:24,686 --> 00:18:26,104
Give me your hand.

318
00:18:26,105 --> 00:18:29,899
He possessed me
and used my body to date Chang Ruyi.

319
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:31,943
Possessed him again? You'll go to hell!

320
00:18:31,944 --> 00:18:33,694
How many times must I tell you?

321
00:18:33,695 --> 00:18:36,364
As long as it's for Ruyi,
I don't care if I go to hell.

322
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:38,741
I'm warning you. Give A-Li his body back.

323
00:18:38,742 --> 00:18:41,495
I'm counting to three. One, two, three!

324
00:18:42,412 --> 00:18:44,163
- Still empty.
- Again. Try again.

325
00:18:44,164 --> 00:18:45,957
One last chance. I'll count to three.

326
00:18:45,958 --> 00:18:48,417
One, two, three!

327
00:18:48,418 --> 00:18:50,670
- Still empty.
- Kid, what happened to you?

328
00:18:50,671 --> 00:18:53,297
- You never listen.
- So stubborn.

329
00:18:53,298 --> 00:18:55,925
- Didn't your parents teach you better?
- You're being selfish.

330
00:18:55,926 --> 00:18:57,635
Love is selfish.

331
00:18:57,636 --> 00:18:59,262
- You...
- Still talking back?

332
00:18:59,263 --> 00:19:01,139
- You're right.
- Right about what?

333
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:04,268
Did A-Li agree to this?
If not, how could you possess him?

334
00:19:05,144 --> 00:19:06,519
Because of love.

335
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:08,939
- You still can't do that.
- But it's love.

336
00:19:10,566 --> 00:19:11,858
I'm done talking to you.

337
00:19:11,859 --> 00:19:13,776
Are you Mr. Tseng Yu-Li?

338
00:19:13,777 --> 00:19:14,945
Who?

339
00:19:15,612 --> 00:19:17,864
Do you recognize the person in this photo?

340
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:20,783
That's you? Not very photogenic.

341
00:19:20,784 --> 00:19:22,160
Who is it?

342
00:19:22,161 --> 00:19:25,079
Nothing. The police have questions.

343
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,664
I'll handle it.

344
00:19:26,665 --> 00:19:28,166
Ruyi...

345
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:30,251
Taozi's crying.

346
00:19:30,252 --> 00:19:32,420
- Why don't you go check on her?
- You love cheat!

347
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:34,547
Is that Strawberry Candy in the photo?

348
00:19:34,548 --> 00:19:36,925
Yeah. Strawberry Candy possessed A-Li.

349
00:19:37,634 --> 00:19:39,385
What's wrong?

350
00:19:39,386 --> 00:19:42,305
You just woke up. Why are you crying?

351
00:19:42,306 --> 00:19:43,973
- Hurry!
- I'm fading!

352
00:19:43,974 --> 00:19:45,559
Quick, give me the phone!

353
00:19:52,232 --> 00:19:56,652
When someone close acts strangely...

354
00:19:56,653 --> 00:19:58,154
- or talks differently...
- Help!

355
00:19:58,155 --> 00:20:01,782
- Uncle's on it.
- ...it could be possession.

356
00:20:01,783 --> 00:20:05,578
- Chang Ruyi...
- A child's urine repels evil spirits.

357
00:20:05,579 --> 00:20:09,498
If you're interested, give it a try.

358
00:20:09,499 --> 00:20:11,001
See you next time!

359
00:20:14,504 --> 00:20:16,422
He wrote this before the accident.

360
00:20:16,423 --> 00:20:18,174
- A child's urine?
- His inheritance.

361
00:20:18,175 --> 00:20:19,508
Half goes to Hope Home,

362
00:20:19,509 --> 00:20:24,180
and half to Chang Ruyi, the woman you saw.

363
00:20:24,181 --> 00:20:27,683
Okay. I'll take these back to the station.

364
00:20:27,684 --> 00:20:30,187
- I'll be in touch.
- Thanks.

365
00:20:32,189 --> 00:20:33,774
What did the police want?

366
00:20:35,734 --> 00:20:39,363
There was a burglary nearby.
He came to investigate.

367
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:43,575
You sound like a friend of mine.

368
00:20:45,702 --> 00:20:47,954
- Do I?
- Don't you think so?

369
00:20:47,955 --> 00:20:49,456
What's your zodiac animal?

370
00:20:50,457 --> 00:20:52,208
I'm a...

371
00:20:52,209 --> 00:20:53,669
- Go on.
- Dog.

372
00:20:55,003 --> 00:20:56,504
Crap. I don't know his zodiac.

373
00:20:56,505 --> 00:20:58,214
Yeah, what's A-Li's zodiac sign?

374
00:20:58,215 --> 00:20:59,424
What are you most afraid of?

375
00:21:02,886 --> 00:21:04,220
I...

376
00:21:04,221 --> 00:21:07,598
Come on, I'm a gangster.

377
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:09,350
What would I be afraid of?

378
00:21:09,351 --> 00:21:10,309
Cockroaches.

379
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,894
Where?

380
00:21:11,895 --> 00:21:12,979
Kill it!

381
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:15,064
Ruyi, you're really smart!

382
00:21:15,065 --> 00:21:16,107
You're not A-Li.

383
00:21:16,108 --> 00:21:18,484
- Busted.
- I used to be scared.

384
00:21:18,485 --> 00:21:20,653
- I might not be scared now.
- Who are you?

385
00:21:20,654 --> 00:21:22,781
- I really am A-Li.
- A-Li fears roaches.

386
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:33,917
So beautiful!

387
00:21:38,839 --> 00:21:40,339
My hand!

388
00:21:40,340 --> 00:21:41,591
A-Li!

389
00:21:42,926 --> 00:21:43,927
No.

390
00:21:45,345 --> 00:21:46,887
It's freezing. So cold.

391
00:21:46,888 --> 00:21:49,308
Ruyi, am I back? Am I back?

392
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:53,311
- Ruyi...
- I don't believe you.

393
00:21:53,312 --> 00:21:55,397
- What's my favorite food?
- You like...

394
00:21:56,648 --> 00:21:57,607
Hot food.

395
00:22:00,068 --> 00:22:01,569
I'm A-Li, Tseng Yu-Li.

396
00:22:01,570 --> 00:22:03,279
My classmates joked I was "strong."

397
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:04,947
- Yu-Li!
- You're back!

398
00:22:04,948 --> 00:22:06,033
I'm back.

399
00:22:07,451 --> 00:22:09,494
Then, where did he go?

400
00:22:10,370 --> 00:22:12,663
How should I know where he went?

401
00:22:12,664 --> 00:22:14,333
I hope he never comes back.

402
00:22:16,335 --> 00:22:17,544
Is he really dead?

403
00:22:19,046 --> 00:22:20,672
Yeah, he's long dead.

404
00:22:21,423 --> 00:22:22,632
Serves him right.

405
00:22:23,633 --> 00:22:25,469
That dream was real?

406
00:22:27,179 --> 00:22:29,180
What dream? He visited your dreams?

407
00:22:29,181 --> 00:22:31,057
Shameless!

408
00:22:31,058 --> 00:22:33,602
Don't say that.
He was actually a pretty good guy.

409
00:22:34,394 --> 00:22:38,482
You seem to care about him a lot.
You keep defending him.

410
00:22:39,316 --> 00:22:40,691
No, I mean...

411
00:22:40,692 --> 00:22:43,444
He died because of me, after all.

412
00:22:43,445 --> 00:22:45,654
I should take some responsibility
for that.

413
00:22:45,655 --> 00:22:46,864
If it weren't for me,

414
00:22:46,865 --> 00:22:49,617
he might still be alive,
living a good life.

415
00:22:49,618 --> 00:22:51,368
- Ruyi, snap out of it!
- He just...

416
00:22:51,369 --> 00:22:53,579
What, do you have Stockholm syndrome?

417
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:56,290
Even after he died, he kept haunting you.

418
00:22:56,291 --> 00:22:58,584
I said no, but he possessed me anyway. I...

419
00:22:58,585 --> 00:23:01,463
- What? I deserved it?
- Yeah, you did.

420
00:23:02,297 --> 00:23:05,382
If you could see him,
why didn't you tell me?

421
00:23:05,383 --> 00:23:06,842
What could I say?

422
00:23:06,843 --> 00:23:09,595
Two other ghosts live here,
a man and a woman.

423
00:23:09,596 --> 00:23:10,763
Would you believe me?

424
00:23:10,764 --> 00:23:12,723
- Want to see him that badly?
- Then answer me.

425
00:23:12,724 --> 00:23:14,850
- Who had dinner with me last night?
- It was him.

426
00:23:14,851 --> 00:23:16,812
- Who rode back with me?
- It was him.

427
00:23:18,688 --> 00:23:21,108
Who usually cooks for me
and takes care of Taozi?

428
00:23:25,278 --> 00:23:28,156
He told me to do that too.
You think I wanted to do it?

429
00:23:30,325 --> 00:23:32,577
So none of it was your choice?
He forced you?

430
00:23:36,123 --> 00:23:37,374
Right.

431
00:23:39,376 --> 00:23:40,251
Great.

432
00:23:40,252 --> 00:23:43,546
He's gone, now you can be yourself.
You're free.

433
00:23:43,547 --> 00:23:45,966
No more taking care of us. Happy now?

434
00:23:47,425 --> 00:23:50,887
I'm so happy. Finally!

435
00:23:52,055 --> 00:23:53,430
I'm happy too!

436
00:23:53,431 --> 00:23:56,433
I finally don't have to eat
all that weird stuff you cook anymore.

437
00:23:56,434 --> 00:23:59,520
You know what? I'm moving out tomorrow.
I'm thrilled!

438
00:23:59,521 --> 00:24:02,774
What? My cooking's that bad, is it? You...

439
00:24:06,361 --> 00:24:08,071
I'm so happy!

440
00:25:07,839 --> 00:25:08,924
Brother Xiao!

441
00:25:24,689 --> 00:25:27,067
- You have a kid?
- My roommate's.

442
00:25:34,282 --> 00:25:37,160
Can't talk around a kid. Come with me.

443
00:25:44,334 --> 00:25:47,629
Brother Xiao, is this about the adoption?

444
00:25:48,255 --> 00:25:50,840
Because of the low birth rate,
there aren't as many...

445
00:25:55,262 --> 00:25:58,431
Why was five million in your office?

446
00:25:59,683 --> 00:26:02,727
I don't know.
I haven't been to the shop lately.

447
00:26:03,812 --> 00:26:06,355
Brother Xiao, why don't you
check the security footage?

448
00:26:06,356 --> 00:26:07,816
It's been erased.

449
00:26:09,025 --> 00:26:11,151
Can you prove it wasn't you?

450
00:26:11,152 --> 00:26:13,195
How can I prove it?

451
00:26:13,196 --> 00:26:18,451
I've been busy looking for a baby girl.
I didn't have time to...

452
00:26:19,995 --> 00:26:21,162
Brother Xiao,

453
00:26:22,622 --> 00:26:25,000
I swear it wasn't me.

454
00:26:40,056 --> 00:26:42,141
If you're lying to me, you're dead.

455
00:26:42,142 --> 00:26:44,018
Find somewhere to lay low

456
00:26:44,019 --> 00:26:46,312
before the guys come looking for trouble.

457
00:26:46,313 --> 00:26:48,523
- You hear me?
- Yes, Brother Xiao.

458
00:26:52,944 --> 00:26:53,903
Let's go.

459
00:27:22,390 --> 00:27:25,393
<i>You don't have to move out. I'll leave.</i>

460
00:27:35,904 --> 00:27:37,197
So, you're leaving?

461
00:27:40,575 --> 00:27:42,409
I don't know how long I'll be away.

462
00:27:42,410 --> 00:27:44,245
What if that nerd comes back?

463
00:27:45,455 --> 00:27:48,917
That child's urine was so powerful,
his soul might be gone for good.

464
00:27:50,335 --> 00:27:52,711
What? You feel sorry for him?

465
00:27:52,712 --> 00:27:54,214
No.

466
00:27:55,757 --> 00:27:56,883
Anyway...

467
00:27:57,550 --> 00:28:01,345
just check on Taozi and Ruyi for me
now and then.

468
00:28:01,346 --> 00:28:03,389
I can only make Taozi cry.

469
00:28:03,390 --> 00:28:05,766
Nonsense. You make her laugh all the time.

470
00:28:05,767 --> 00:28:08,770
- Shut up! Would it kill you to be quiet?
- I'm already dead.

471
00:28:10,230 --> 00:28:12,232
I know you're good ghosts,

472
00:28:13,358 --> 00:28:14,859
so I'm counting on you.

473
00:28:17,070 --> 00:28:18,113
I'm off.

474
00:28:28,873 --> 00:28:30,375
Where should I hide out?

475
00:28:34,462 --> 00:28:35,630
Hengchun?

476
00:28:43,138 --> 00:28:44,556
"A202."

477
00:28:59,112 --> 00:29:00,613
I don't know where you are,

478
00:29:01,531 --> 00:29:03,283
but I need a place to hide.

479
00:29:04,325 --> 00:29:07,370
You took over my body,
so I'll take over your place.

480
00:29:09,622 --> 00:29:11,291
If that's okay,

481
00:29:12,292 --> 00:29:13,835
give me a sign.

482
00:29:18,715 --> 00:29:19,758
Thanks.

483
00:29:50,455 --> 00:29:52,165
Yu-Li, help me...

484
00:29:56,711 --> 00:30:00,339
Taozi, wait a second. Mommy will come
once I finish wrapping this.

485
00:30:00,340 --> 00:30:01,758
Just wait. I'll be quick.

486
00:30:02,717 --> 00:30:04,968
Stop playing with that bird.

487
00:30:04,969 --> 00:30:07,555
A-Li asked us to look after Taozi.

488
00:30:15,980 --> 00:30:19,066
Little Taozi, Auntie's here!

489
00:30:19,067 --> 00:30:20,901
Hello!

490
00:30:20,902 --> 00:30:24,279
Who's the prettiest auntie
in the whole world?

491
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:25,615
Definitely not you.

492
00:30:26,616 --> 00:30:28,368
Look at this little bunny!

493
00:30:35,625 --> 00:30:39,087
A-Li said an uncle and auntie are here.

494
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,632
Are you helping look after Taozi?

495
00:30:46,386 --> 00:30:47,512
Thank you so much.

496
00:30:48,596 --> 00:30:49,848
Thank you.

497
00:31:01,109 --> 00:31:04,778
She's very polite.

498
00:31:04,779 --> 00:31:08,366
She's so well-mannered.
She didn't even insult my mom.

499
00:31:10,869 --> 00:31:14,289
She's a good match for our A-Li.

500
00:31:16,374 --> 00:31:19,334
I'm sorry I wasn't very nice
to you before.

501
00:31:19,335 --> 00:31:21,211
No, I was worse.

502
00:31:21,212 --> 00:31:24,631
I even scared her like this
on her first day here.

503
00:31:24,632 --> 00:31:26,383
How are you the bad one?

504
00:31:26,384 --> 00:31:27,676
She's already so busy,

505
00:31:27,677 --> 00:31:32,097
and we made Taozi cry
and made things even harder for her.

506
00:31:32,098 --> 00:31:36,018
Taozi cried because you're so ugly.

507
00:31:36,019 --> 00:31:37,312
Really?

508
00:31:38,062 --> 00:31:42,233
You should look in a mirror.
You're even uglier now.

509
00:32:04,505 --> 00:32:07,341
What's wrong with your baby?
Why is she crying?

510
00:32:07,342 --> 00:32:09,885
- She looks so skinny.
- Don't touch her, please.

511
00:32:09,886 --> 00:32:13,138
You're not taking good care of her.
She's so skinny.

512
00:32:13,139 --> 00:32:14,307
Why do you care?

513
00:32:19,771 --> 00:32:20,980
Okay, okay.

514
00:32:30,114 --> 00:32:31,282
Thanks.

515
00:32:42,293 --> 00:32:43,753
I'll make you a bottle.

516
00:32:51,678 --> 00:32:53,638
Don't cry. Come here, Mommy's got you.

517
00:33:03,856 --> 00:33:05,649
Don't cry, okay?

518
00:33:05,650 --> 00:33:07,401
Don't cry.

519
00:33:07,402 --> 00:33:08,653
What now?

520
00:33:10,530 --> 00:33:12,448
<i>Do you think...</i>

521
00:33:13,032 --> 00:33:15,158
those two ghosts
are taking good care of them?

522
00:33:15,159 --> 00:33:16,576
<i>Don't worry.</i>

523
00:33:16,577 --> 00:33:18,578
<i>We'll figure it out.</i>

524
00:33:18,579 --> 00:33:20,497
I think so too.

525
00:33:20,498 --> 00:33:21,916
They're such goofballs.

526
00:33:29,549 --> 00:33:31,758
Baldy!

527
00:33:31,759 --> 00:33:33,343
- Baldy returned Ruyi's stuff.
- Now?

528
00:33:33,344 --> 00:33:35,053
- What now?
- Call him.

529
00:33:35,054 --> 00:33:39,433
Baldy...

530
00:33:39,434 --> 00:33:40,518
Taozi is crying.

531
00:33:43,646 --> 00:33:46,149
Ruyi, time to change her diaper.

532
00:33:51,863 --> 00:33:54,781
Didn't he say to send this to...

533
00:33:54,782 --> 00:33:58,118
- The orphanage? Or...
<i>- Yes! How nice. You're so thoughtful.</i>

534
00:33:58,119 --> 00:34:00,038
<i>Send it to Xindian District, New Taipei.</i>

535
00:34:05,793 --> 00:34:07,711
Hello, Roro. What's up?

536
00:34:07,712 --> 00:34:10,464
<i>A-Hu's men are after you. Stay safe.</i>

537
00:34:10,465 --> 00:34:12,424
I'm not home. Don't worry.

538
00:34:12,425 --> 00:34:14,469
Okay, I'm busy. Talk later. Bye-bye.

539
00:34:24,604 --> 00:34:26,063
<i>Your body wash is bad.</i>

540
00:34:26,064 --> 00:34:28,023
<i>- Your soap gave me a rash!
- Give me a refund!</i>

541
00:34:28,024 --> 00:34:30,442
<i>- Yeah, I got a reaction too.
- Your labeling is unclear.</i>

542
00:34:30,443 --> 00:34:31,694
<i>You're misleading people.</i>

543
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:38,867
I'm A-Li. I'm the one you want.

544
00:34:38,868 --> 00:34:40,368
I didn't take the five million.

545
00:34:40,369 --> 00:34:41,495
<i>You're a liar.</i>

546
00:34:41,496 --> 00:34:43,497
<i>- Call the police?
- Don't let her go.</i>

547
00:34:43,498 --> 00:34:46,041
<i>I know where you live.
You won't get away with this.</i>

548
00:34:46,042 --> 00:34:48,252
<i>- I didn't know you were like this.
- Pay me a million.</i>

549
00:34:57,929 --> 00:34:59,846
<i>You're a new mom, so I supported you.</i>

550
00:34:59,847 --> 00:35:02,140
<i>I never thought you'd be like this.</i>

551
00:35:02,141 --> 00:35:03,434
<i>Call the police.</i>

552
00:35:17,406 --> 00:35:18,532
<i>I know a famous lawyer.</i>

553
00:35:18,533 --> 00:35:19,991
<i>- Yeah.
- Pay my medical bills.</i>

554
00:35:19,992 --> 00:35:21,577
I told you to stop crying.

555
00:35:29,377 --> 00:35:31,169
<i>You're not taking good care of her.</i>

556
00:35:31,170 --> 00:35:32,879
<i>- She won't stop crying.
- So thin.</i>

557
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:34,422
<i>I'm calling the cops.</i>

558
00:35:34,423 --> 00:35:36,174
<i>Your customers all know you had a baby.</i>

559
00:35:36,175 --> 00:35:37,801
<i>You can't do this after having a baby.</i>

560
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:40,178
<i>- Refund our money!
- We're calling the cops.</i>

561
00:35:40,179 --> 00:35:43,558
<i>- You're not caring for her.
- Then don't have kids.</i>

562
00:35:50,481 --> 00:35:53,316
Why lie here?
How will the bikes get through?

563
00:35:53,317 --> 00:35:54,318
A-Li?

564
00:35:55,027 --> 00:35:56,945
A-Li! Are you okay?

565
00:35:56,946 --> 00:35:58,823
Uncle, help me!

566
00:35:59,615 --> 00:36:01,408
Help me...

567
00:36:01,409 --> 00:36:02,952
I can't stand blood...

568
00:36:03,744 --> 00:36:05,079
Uncle...

569
00:36:06,998 --> 00:36:08,207
Chang Ruyi!

570
00:36:08,875 --> 00:36:09,917
Taozi!

571
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:16,549
- Lie down.
- Okay.

572
00:36:18,092 --> 00:36:20,052
The doctor said you need to rest.

573
00:36:22,346 --> 00:36:25,600
Security found a cloud backup
of the footage.

574
00:36:27,226 --> 00:36:28,644
Tongban took the money.

575
00:36:29,353 --> 00:36:31,480
I'll kill him when I find him.

576
00:36:32,440 --> 00:36:35,817
They won't come after me again, right?

577
00:36:35,818 --> 00:36:36,818
Don't worry.

578
00:36:36,819 --> 00:36:39,280
I'll tell A-Hu it was Tongban.

579
00:36:40,239 --> 00:36:43,034
Your girlfriend and kid will be safe.

580
00:36:45,745 --> 00:36:46,787
Okay.

581
00:36:49,081 --> 00:36:50,291
Get some rest.

582
00:36:50,958 --> 00:36:52,460
You don't need to worry

583
00:36:53,044 --> 00:36:54,879
about the adoption anymore.

584
00:36:56,130 --> 00:36:58,048
I'll talk to your sister-in-law.

585
00:36:58,049 --> 00:36:59,258
Brother Xiao,

586
00:37:00,343 --> 00:37:02,553
didn't you think Sister Zhenzhu
couldn't handle it?

587
00:37:03,512 --> 00:37:05,598
She keeps asking to see the baby.

588
00:37:09,185 --> 00:37:10,811
I can't lie anymore.

589
00:37:12,605 --> 00:37:13,648
And you?

590
00:37:14,273 --> 00:37:16,776
You said the baby was your friend's.

591
00:37:17,568 --> 00:37:19,320
Were you afraid to tell me

592
00:37:21,072 --> 00:37:22,740
you were a dad?

593
00:37:26,869 --> 00:37:27,912
A-Li,

594
00:37:29,163 --> 00:37:31,958
take care of your kid.

595
00:37:34,335 --> 00:37:35,711
Yes, Brother Xiao.

596
00:39:38,209 --> 00:39:39,543
Ruyi!

597
00:39:53,391 --> 00:39:55,350
What's going on? It's all smoke!

598
00:39:55,351 --> 00:39:56,851
Smoke everywhere. Anyone there?

599
00:39:56,852 --> 00:39:57,978
Open up!

600
00:40:01,023 --> 00:40:02,524
Anyone home?

601
00:40:02,525 --> 00:40:05,528
It's dangerous! There's smoke everywhere!

602
00:40:08,572 --> 00:40:09,990
Anyone in there? Open up!

603
00:40:10,908 --> 00:40:12,659
What happened? What...

604
00:40:12,660 --> 00:40:13,827
I fell asleep.

605
00:40:13,828 --> 00:40:15,412
You...

606
00:40:15,413 --> 00:40:16,871
No.

607
00:40:16,872 --> 00:40:18,206
- Uncle Wu!
- No!

608
00:40:18,207 --> 00:40:19,125
It's dangerous!

609
00:40:21,794 --> 00:40:24,712
- Sir, get out now!
- How did this happen?

610
00:40:24,713 --> 00:40:26,423
What? You...

611
00:40:26,424 --> 00:40:29,008
- I fell asleep.
- Your kitchen was on fire!

612
00:40:29,009 --> 00:40:30,635
You fell asleep?

613
00:40:30,636 --> 00:40:32,262
How can you be a mom?

614
00:40:32,263 --> 00:40:36,015
Hurry! Look how much she's crying!
Hurry! You two go to the hospital.

615
00:40:36,016 --> 00:40:37,392
One, two, three, four.

616
00:40:37,393 --> 00:40:38,977
- One, two, three, four.
- She...

617
00:40:38,978 --> 00:40:40,562
- Mom, out of here!
- Six.

618
00:40:40,563 --> 00:40:41,896
- One, two, three.
- Seven.

619
00:40:41,897 --> 00:40:43,356
- One, two, three.
- Let me listen.

620
00:40:43,357 --> 00:40:44,316
Okay.

621
00:40:48,028 --> 00:40:51,240
Resuscitation failed, 7:15 am, April 15.

622
00:40:53,617 --> 00:40:55,244
Taozi...

623
00:40:57,204 --> 00:40:58,330
How could you do this?

624
00:40:58,998 --> 00:41:01,124
She's just a baby.
You should've stayed with her.

625
00:41:01,125 --> 00:41:02,750
She's so little.

626
00:41:02,751 --> 00:41:04,544
How could you do this to her?

627
00:41:04,545 --> 00:41:06,463
How unlucky she got a mom like you.

628
00:41:06,464 --> 00:41:07,923
Crying won't help now.

629
00:41:13,179 --> 00:41:15,306
<i>No. 25.</i>

630
00:41:20,603 --> 00:41:21,604
Is Chang Ruyi here?

631
00:41:22,438 --> 00:41:23,481
Chang Ruyi.

632
00:41:24,231 --> 00:41:25,399
Chang Ruyi.

633
00:41:29,570 --> 00:41:32,071
- Chang Ruyi.
- I...

634
00:41:32,072 --> 00:41:35,575
Are you Chang Ruyi?
Remember to pay and pick up your medicine.

635
00:41:35,576 --> 00:41:37,369
Don't forget to schedule your follow-up.

636
00:41:38,329 --> 00:41:39,579
Sorry.

637
00:41:39,580 --> 00:41:42,749
The doctor said
I have postpartum depression.

638
00:41:42,750 --> 00:41:45,543
Is it serious?

639
00:41:45,544 --> 00:41:47,505
Can your family take care of you?

640
00:41:49,507 --> 00:41:51,383
I don't have a family.

641
00:41:51,967 --> 00:41:55,638
Can you ask a relative or friend for help?
Don't forget your follow-up.

642
00:42:00,684 --> 00:42:03,561
That guy from 1206 is unbelievable.

643
00:42:03,562 --> 00:42:06,397
He comes every day
asking about babies for adoption.

644
00:42:06,398 --> 00:42:08,191
Money doesn't buy you everything.

645
00:42:08,192 --> 00:42:10,527
No, his wife is the one I feel sorry for.

646
00:42:10,528 --> 00:42:15,199
She tried for so long to get pregnant,
but the baby died right after birth.

647
00:42:40,724 --> 00:42:41,725
Taozi,

648
00:42:43,227 --> 00:42:46,604
you'll be better off here.

649
00:42:46,605 --> 00:42:48,606
Mommy almost hurt you.

650
00:42:48,607 --> 00:42:50,276
I'm not a good mom.

651
00:42:52,236 --> 00:42:54,446
You'll be better off here.

652
00:43:09,878 --> 00:43:11,338
Come here.

653
00:43:12,256 --> 00:43:14,090
Don't cry.

654
00:43:14,091 --> 00:43:15,801
I'm sorry.

655
00:43:17,636 --> 00:43:19,178
You'll be better off here.

656
00:43:19,179 --> 00:43:20,680
Please don't cry.

657
00:43:20,681 --> 00:43:22,808
Don't cry.

658
00:43:25,978 --> 00:43:28,022
Who's outside? What's all that noise?

659
00:44:51,814 --> 00:44:54,190
<i>- Where's Taozi now?
- You don't need to know.</i>

660
00:44:54,191 --> 00:44:56,109
Let's go get her.

661
00:44:56,110 --> 00:44:57,402
I'll help take care of her.

662
00:44:57,403 --> 00:45:00,446
You come and go as you please.
How can I trust you?

663
00:45:00,447 --> 00:45:02,615
<i>Ruyi closed the door.</i>

664
00:45:02,616 --> 00:45:05,201
You can open it.

665
00:45:05,202 --> 00:45:08,579
<i>Stay healthy, and you can bring
your child home. Right?</i>

666
00:45:08,580 --> 00:45:11,333
<i>I didn't want to give her up.</i>

667
00:45:12,000 --> 00:45:13,793
<i>Do you really love Ruyi?</i>

668
00:45:13,794 --> 00:45:16,504
Ruyi always looks grumpy.

669
00:45:16,505 --> 00:45:18,172
She's cute when she smiles, right?

670
00:45:18,173 --> 00:45:19,675
<i>Give me my daughter back.</i>
